  "authoring": "Native pixel material and blade recipes extend the current pack with a deeper emerald ramp. Short blade graphs target roughly half Caelan visible height; foreground tips are shorter so only legs are obscured. Original packs are read only.",
  "notes": [
    "Ground motifs are designed clusters, not uniform per-pixel noise.",
    "All tile borders share the emerald base green for seamless composition.",
    "All tall-grass states preserve the same hard-alpha roots in rows26..28.",
    "All combined opaque frames, including seedheads, stay at most17px high: half Caelan34px visible height. Upright silhouettes are16\u201317px. Foreground tips stay within5px above the root to cover legs only.",
    "Tall grass is visual, fully walkable and owned by a separate interactive layer."
  ],
  "height_limits": {
    "rear": 18,
    "front": 5
  },
  "opaque_height_limit": 17
}
